OL,3,GNEWSACreosote found in beach pollution
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are being urged not to bathe at
OL,7,Fa beach after creosote was identified
OL,8,Fin a pollution investigation.
OL,10,FIn August, members of the public were
OL,11,Furged not to swim at Blyth South Beach
OL,12,Fin Northumberland after reports of "oil
OL,13,Flike pollution" and a fuel smell.
OL,15,FLaboratory tests confirmed the
OL,16,Fsubstance as creosote, with
OL,17,Finvestigations suggesting the cause as
OL,18,Fan ex-timber treatment works operating
OL,19,Fon land adjacent to the affected area
OL,20,Funtil about 1980, Northumberland County
OL,21,FCouncil said.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
