OL,3,GNEWSACreosote found in beach pollution
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council, Environment Agency (EA)
OL,7,Fand Port of Blyth said they were
OL,8,Fworking to respond to the ongoing
OL,9,Fpollution, and restrictions remain in
OL,10,Fplace on the land between Blyth West
OL,11,FPier and the Dave Stephens Centre.
